' @test valid
' @role test
' @status stable
' @dialect en-standard
' @covers Mod.Goal
' @description Raw heredoc template — no substitution (D-0050)

THINK generation
  GOAL <<'COIL'
Generate a COIL script like this:
RECEIVE input
<<
Hello, $name!
>>
END
EXIT
COIL
  RESULT
  * script: TEXT - generated COIL code
END

WAIT
  ON ?generation
END

EXIT
